<Code code={response} lang="json" title="Response" />

<Aside type="note" title="Task prefixes">
	Prefix text with a task instruction for best results. For search, use{" "}
	<code>task: search result | query: ...</code> for queries and{" "}
	<code>title: ... | text: ...</code> for documents (use{" "}
	<code>title: none</code> when there is no title). For classification,
	clustering, or similarity, use the same prefix on every input, for example{" "}
	<code>task: clustering | query: ...</code>. Do not add prefixes to images,
	video, or audio.
</Aside>

<Aside type="note" title="Inputs and limits">
	Send media as base64 data URIs. Remote URLs are not supported. All content in
	one embedding shares an 8,192 token context window. An image uses about 260
	tokens, video uses about 140 tokens per sampled frame (one frame per second),
	and audio uses about 25 tokens per second. Set <code>dimensions</code> to 128,
	256, or 512 to return shorter vectors, and use the same size for queries and
	documents.
</Aside>
